WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.040
Speaker 1: . Fox News host Howard KURTZ admits&nbsp;
he's not talking about the Dominion lawsuit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:12.840
against Fox News because Fox News told him,&nbsp;
You're not allowed to talk about this. Now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:17.880
a lot of people are making a very, very big deal&nbsp;
out of this. I'm going to give you my view of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:24.600
it in a moment. Howard KURTZ does like the media&nbsp;
watchdog show on Fox News. The show is pretty bad.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:33.000
But the point here is he brings this up. Dominion&nbsp;
is suing Fox News over their role in promoting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.380
conspiracy theories about Dominion voting&nbsp;
machines in the aftermath of the 2020 election.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:42.960
Howard KURTZ and others on Fox News haven't&nbsp;
talked about it. Why? Howard KURTZ explains.&nbsp;

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:47.340
Speaker 2: Some of you have been asking why I'm&nbsp;
not covering the Dominion voting machines lawsuit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:51.960
against Fox involving the unproven claims of&nbsp;
election fraud in 2020. And it's absolutely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:56.220
a fair question. Yes, I believe I should be&nbsp;
covering it. It's a major media story given my&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.220 --> 00:01:00.480
role here at FOX. But the company has decided&nbsp;
that as part of the organization being sued,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:04.920
I can't talk about it or write about it, at&nbsp;
least for now. I strongly disagree with that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:09.169
decision. But as an employee, I have to abide&nbsp;
by it. And if that changes, I'll let you know.&nbsp;

00:01:09.169 --> 00:01:14.160
Speaker 1: Yeah. So many of you have pointed&nbsp;
out to me that Fox News is completely silent&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:20.580
about the fact that there is this massive lawsuit.&nbsp;
And the discovery led to the revelation of those&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:26.280
texts wherein we learned that Fox News hosts who&nbsp;
on air were pretending like there was merit to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:30.600
things being said by Donald Trump about the 2020&nbsp;
election. We're texting each other and admitting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:34.740
it's all lies. It's all crazy. There's nothing&nbsp;
here. It's a major story and Fox News hasn't been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:39.900
talking about it. Now, I have to tell you, this is&nbsp;
not the big shocker that some are making it out to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:45.000
be. There is no doubt about the newsworthiness&nbsp;
of the subject matter. And I'll tell you what,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:49.980
I think no matter what, Fox News hosts&nbsp;
wouldn't be allowed to talk about it. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.700 --> 00:02:00.300
it is true that any lawyer worth anything would&nbsp;
tell Fox News, don't talk about this lawsuit on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:06.540
the air because it can only create more problems&nbsp;
for you. Best case scenario, it doesn't help you,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:13.080
but it doesn't hurt you. Worst case scenario,&nbsp;
you do what Alex Jones was doing daily on his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:19.140
program while the defamation suit against him&nbsp;
was going on. And you just damage yourself. So.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:26.220
I think no matter what, like aside from lawyers&nbsp;
making the suggestion, Fox News is probably&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:32.280
determined this isn't a good thing for us to be&nbsp;
talking about regardless. But there is no way&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.280 --> 00:02:39.480
that lawyers aren't for Fox News, aren't saying do&nbsp;
not talk about the lawsuit on the air. So the most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:44.700
you could say about, you know, someone like Howard&nbsp;
KURTZ is if you really disagree with it that much,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:51.480
then you should leave. That's perfectly fair&nbsp;
thing to say. At the same time, it's expected&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:57.000
CNN would do the same thing. MSNBC would do&nbsp;
the same thing. In this situation. It would be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:02.640
quite silly to be talking about the lawsuit. Alex&nbsp;
Jones did it and we saw how well that went for him

